### Courser HTTP scratch pad
### Call the gateway with /api. Quiz routes need a Bearer token from login/register.
### Gateway: http://localhost:8080

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = replace-with-jwt-from-login

### Register
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "Haslo123!"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Haslo123!"
}

### List quizzes
GET {{base}}/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one quiz (questions + answers)
GET {{base}}/quizzes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create quiz
POST {{base}}/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Geografia",
  "scoring": null,
  "limits": { "randomQuestionOrder": false, "showCorrectAnswers": true },
  "questions": [
    {
      "content": "Jaka jest stolica Polski?",
      "image": null,
      "answers": [
        { "content": "Warszawa", "correct": true, "points": null },
        { "content": "Kraków", "correct": false, "points": null }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Fork (server-side copy, no body)
POST {{base}}/quizzes/1/fork
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ranking leaderboard
GET {{base}}/quizzes/1/ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Share-code preview (public)
POST {{base}}/quizzes/share-code-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ABCDE-FGHIJ"
}

### Daily statistics
GET {{base}}/users/me/statistics/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
